  "selected_clauses": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 2.26,
      "end": 6.72,
      "text": "这条裙子你看似简单,其实它用量非常的大,因为它这里有一个大褶,",
      "members": [
        1
      ],
      "group": 0,
      "role": "hook",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 34.86,
      "end": 39.02,
      "text": "像这种面料的话基本上都是供应设置品的百分百羊毛的这条裙子",
      "members": [
        7
      ],
      "group": 1,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 70.83,
      "end": 74.11,
      "text": "百分百全羊毛而且是纯抢眼工艺的",
      "members": [
        20
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 75.85,
      "end": 80.79,
      "text": "它是属于双色羊毛它的颜色是花纱工艺",
      "members": [
        22,
        23
      ],
      "group": 3,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 81.15,
      "end": 88.43,
      "text": "它不是定染的这种料子是染不出来的这种东叫色芝它要用多种颜色的羊毛芝在一起深浅故意做出那种渐变的感觉",
      "members": [
        24,
        25,
        26,
        27,
        28
      ],
      "group": 3,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 89.49,
      "end": 92.29,
      "text": "他整个的面料质感是非常贵气的",
      "members": [
        30
      ],
      "group": 4,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "start": 251.96,
      "end": 254.96,
      "text": "而且是强年的工艺去做的这款超细羊毛",
      "members": [
        107
      ],
      "group": 5,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "start": 258.14,
      "end": 259.66,
      "text": "姐妹们这是羊毛的整个双面",
      "members": [
        110
      ],
      "group": 6,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 163,
      "start": 365.05,
      "end": 369.43,
      "text": "强颜的整个工艺经过毛林片的播出之后这种羊毛是一点一点都不再炸的",
      "members": [
        163,
        164
      ],
      "group": 7,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 209,
      "start": 450.22,
      "end": 451.4,
      "text": "他透气性怎么这么好呢",
      "members": [
        209
      ],
      "group": 8,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 210,
      "start": 452.08,
      "end": 455.6,
      "text": "可舒服了一点都不扎你们自己看这个透光性你现在拿回去一直能",
      "members": [
        210
      ],
      "group": 8,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 134,
      "start": 308.29,
      "end": 309.95,
      "text": "这款的灭料客众更高",
      "members": [
        134
      ],
      "group": 9,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 135,
      "start": 310.39,
      "end": 312.65,
      "text": "而且它的整个支法工艺更加的高级",
      "members": [
        135
      ],
      "group": 9,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 117.51,
      "end": 119.79,
      "text": "它就是卡在胯上的它没有那么的瘦",
      "members": [
        47,
        48
      ],
      "group": 10,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 120.25,
      "end": 121.21,
      "text": "它是偏休闲的",
      "members": [
        49
      ],
      "group": 10,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 129.11,
      "end": 130.23,
      "text": "有一点点学员风",
      "members": [
        56
