      "group": 11,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 81,
      "start": 194.78,
      "end": 196.36,
      "text": "有一点点学院风的中群",
      "members": [
        81
      ],
      "group": 11,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 126.09,
      "end": 127.05,
      "text": "这是今年最新一季的",
      "members": [
        53
      ],
      "group": 12,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "start": 226.56,
      "end": 233.02,
      "text": "但是这个长度我觉得既能让我穿出那种很简凌的感觉但是他整个的那种自在的松弛的感觉他还很在线",
      "members": [
        98,
        99
      ],
      "group": 13,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "start": 233.44,
      "end": 235.52,
      "text": "所以这个裙子我觉得是超级漂亮啊姐妹们",
      "members": [
